!
ROC= 11
!************IMPORTANT NOTIFICATION*********************
!ROC11 uses slot0, but that will cause error when reading.
!Modifying source code is little bit hard, so I re-defined 
!slot# in this mapfile as 
!(real slot#)+1.
!And in the g_decode_all_bank.f and g_decode_fb_detector.f,
!I inserted a if statement for each to read correct slot#.
! Aug25, 2009  D.Kawama
!******************************************************* 
!
!*******************************************************
!     EDC MAP FOR E05115 D.Kawama & A.Shichijo    
!*******************************************************
!
!
